# "bell arp" then "digi arp" (arp track): short notes in the C5 - C7 range on the small mips, velocities from soft
# (gentler waves: the position drops by (100 - velocity) / 2) to hard.
tempo 140
steps 16
tail 2.0
track arp
preset 200 255 0 50 0 50 0 0 128 0 128 195 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C6 1 127
note 1 E6 1 60
note 2 G6 1 100
note 3 C7 1 20
note 4 G6 1 127
note 5 E6 1 80
note 6 C6 1 127
note 7 G5 1 40
param p1 220 8
param p2 128 8
param decay 30 8
note 8 C5 1 127
note 9 G5 1 90
note 10 C6 1 127
note 11 Eb6 1 50
note 12 G6 1 127
note 13 C6 1 70
note 14 G5 1 127
note 15 Eb5 1 30
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 30
expect peak_below -4
